{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝5時に起きて\nいまさっきお仕事おわったよー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ながーーーーい1日でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも楽しかったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"移動バスの中で活動時間が長いと\n食欲がいつもより増すよね\nって会話が聞こえたんだけど\nその通りだと思うって心で思ってたの！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝てることって幸せなことだよね(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝て気持ちよくて幸せで\n夢の中ではいろいろなことが起きて\n食欲もわかないし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/13/8449180/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/13/8449180/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"魔女っ子ひなっ子！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/13/8449180/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたも撮影があるからがんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ね、納豆にハマってるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卵たれの納豆！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通のたれじゃないやつ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"納豆は大粒派？小粒派？普通派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は絶対小粒派だったけど\n最近は普通のも選ぶようになった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは変わったことってなんだろ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー、刺激がくる飲み物を\nあんまり飲まなくなった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"例えば炭酸とか！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"牛乳、お水、お茶が多くなった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジュース飲む時は100パーセントジュースとか\nスムージー系！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのくらいかな～\n最近の変化は！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/13/8449180/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/13/8449180/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影の合間にこんな顔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまこんな顔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/13/8449180/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこのへんで！またあした！"}],"source":"archive"}